<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bufete raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bufete raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co said on Friday it had raised Bufete Industrial SA de CV to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- In a research report, Oppenheimer said Bufete's upgrade was &quot;based on our expectation of 10-15 percent EBITDA growth through 1999 from increased Mexican and international construction activity.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Bufete was off 1/8 to 17-1/4 in early trade in New York.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212 859-1730</p>
</text>
